> **Mutation rules**: This diagram is mutable. If phase audits show the
> workflow doesn't match reality, update the diagram. Always preserve BEGIN
> and END nodes. Decision diamonds must remain clear. Append a note below
> the diagram explaining the change.
>
> **Change log**:
> - 2026-05-23: Split Phase 2 into Sub-Wave 2a (Core Contracts) and Sub-Wave 2b
>   (Dependent Infrastructure) with a mini-audit verification gate between them.
>   Rationale: FB9 showed parallel foundation agents racing on shared dependencies
>   (AsyncSessionLocal missing, get_current_user signature mismatch, env drift).

flowchart TD
    BEGIN([BEGIN])
    P0[Phase 0: Viability Check<br/>S5 Main Agent]
    P0D{<choice>trivial</choice>?}
    P0R[Read .kimi/lessons.md<br/>Write plan.md]
    P1[Phase 1: Intelligence<br/>vsm_architect subagent]
    P1H{<choice>S3/S4 deadlock</choice>?}
    P1A[EnterPlanMode<br/>User Approval]
    P1D{<choice>approved</choice>?}

    P2A[Sub-Wave 2a: Core Contracts<br/>models + auth + config + shared types<br/>2-3 coder agents, parallel]
    P2AS[TaskOutput block=true]
    P2AV{<choice>2a mini-audit<br/>passes</choice>?}
    P2B[Sub-Wave 2b: Dependent Infrastructure<br/>GraphQL + Socket.io + routers + frontend<br/>2-3 coder agents, parallel]
    P2BS[TaskOutput block=true]
    P2A_AUDIT[Phase 2b: Audit<br/>vsm_auditor on all foundation files]
    P2M[Phase 2c: Model Validation<br/>S5 checks models.py vs data-model.md]
    P2D{<choice>BLOCKERs</choice>?}

    P3[Phase 3: Implementation Wave<br/>Parallel coder agents]
    P3S[TaskOutput block=true]
    P3A[Phase 3b: Audit + Coordination<br/>vsm_auditor + vsm_coordinator]
    P3D{<choice>BLOCKERs</choice>?}
    P3E[Entry Point Wiring<br/>MANDATORY]
    P4[Phase 4: Testing + Infra Wave<br/>vsm_tester + coder]
    P4S[TaskOutput block=true]
    P4R[Shell: run tests]
    P5[Phase 5: Integration Verification<br/>vsm_coordinator + vsm_auditor]
    P5D{<choice>ANY failure</choice>?}
    P6[Phase 6: Security Gate<br/>vsm_security]
    P6D{<choice>CRITICAL/HIGH</choice>?}
    P6L[Document LOW as<br/>known limitation]
    P7[Phase 7: Fix Wave<br/>coder agents]
    P7R[Re-audit changed files]
    P7D{<choice>BLOCKERs remain<br/>iterations < 3</choice>?}
    P7E[Escalate to User<br/>AskUserQuestion]
    P7S[Phase 7b: Post-Fix Security Re-Check<br/>vsm_security on modified auth/GraphQL/WebSocket]
    P7F{<choice>regressions found</choice>?}
    P8[Phase 8: Reflection<br/>Append to .kimi/lessons.md]
    P8M[Phase 8b: Meta-Reflection + Hypothesis Generation]
    END([END])

    BEGIN --> P0
    P0 --> P0D
    P0D -->|<choice>yes</choice>| END
    P0D -->|<choice>no</choice>| P0R
    P0R --> P1
    P1 --> P1H
    P1H -->|<choice>yes</choice>| P1
    P1H -->|<choice>no</choice>| P1A
    P1A --> P1D
    P1D -->|<choice>rejected</choice>| P1
    P1D -->|<choice>approved</choice>| P2A

    P2A --> P2AS
    P2AS --> P2AV
    P2AV -->|<choice>no</choice>| P7
    P2AV -->|<choice>yes</choice>| P2B
    P2B --> P2BS
    P2BS --> P2A_AUDIT
    P2A_AUDIT --> P2M
    P2M --> P2D
    P2D -->|<choice>yes</choice>| P7
    P2D -->|<choice>no</choice>| P3

    P3 --> P3S
    P3S --> P3A
    P3A --> P3D
    P3D -->|<choice>yes</choice>| P7
    P3D -->|<choice>no</choice>| P3E
    P3E --> P4
    P4 --> P4S
    P4S --> P4R
    P4R --> P5
    P5 --> P5D
    P5D -->|<choice>yes</choice>| P3
    P5D -->|<choice>no</choice>| P6
    P6 --> P6D
    P6D -->|<choice>yes</choice>| P7
    P6D -->|<choice>LOW only</choice>| P6L
    P6D -->|<choice>none</choice>| P8
    P6L --> P8
    P7 --> P7R
    P7R --> P7D
    P7D -->|<choice>yes</choice>| P7
    P7D -->|<choice>no, max reached</choice>| P7E
    P7D -->|<choice>no, all clear</choice>| P7S
    P7S --> P7F
    P7F -->|<choice>yes</choice>| P7
    P7F -->|<choice>no</choice>| P8
    P7E --> END
    P8 --> P8M
    P8M --> END
